{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","万物有灵"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","吟唱技能，对全体友军持续产生治疗，受到响应的“花灵”将会对敌方全体造成伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","娑丽丝进入生灵亲和姿态，并产生3个覆盖全场的治疗波纹，治疗波纹会对波及到的友军施加140% + 22% ATK的治疗。当友方“花灵”接触到治疗波纹时，会立即响应，以被祝福的友军为中心向全场扩散一道水环，对所有敌人造成30% + 3% ATK的伤害。本技能释放期间，娑丽丝获得霸体。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":45,"end":51,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":111,"end":116,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":41,"end":55,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":108,"end":120,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":137,"end":139,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","治疗量提升至160% + 22% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","治疗量提升至180% + 22% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","治疗量提升至200% + 22% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","治疗量提升至220% + 22% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","祝福之种"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","为己方全体非召唤物友军附加“芽种”，满足条件时将会成长为“花灵”，会为被祝福单位持续提供治疗和增益效果。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，娑丽丝为所有己方非召唤物友军送上自然祝福，将“芽种”送至他们身边，“芽种”每3秒会为被祝福友军提供40% + 10% ATK治疗。本技能释放期间，娑丽丝获得霸体。\n战斗中，“芽种”会吸收该友军受到的治疗溢出，当溢出值达到娑丽丝初始攻击力600%时，“芽种”会成长为“花灵”，并额外使该友军永久提升娑丽丝初始攻击力15% + 1.5%的攻击力。当娑丽丝被击败时，“花灵”及“芽种”带来的效果不会消失，但无法再进行提升，也无法再响应娑丽丝。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":58,"end":64,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":165,"end":172,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":55,"end":68,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":84,"end":86,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“芽种”提供的治疗量提升至60% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“芽种”提供的治疗量提升至80% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“芽种”提供的治疗量提升至100% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","花语秘法"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","为最虚弱的数名友军恢复生命值。已有“花灵”跟随的友军额外获得护盾效果。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","娑丽丝改良植物药剂中的魔力，在最虚弱的2名友军身上绽放花朵，使其回复190% + 25% ATK的生命值。若受到治疗的友军身边已有“花灵”跟随，则“花灵”会立刻响应娑丽丝，为被祝福友军施加一个可抵御250% + 25% ATK伤害的永久护盾，护盾最高不超过900% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":44,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":103,"end":109,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":99,"end":113,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":128,"end":136,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","治疗量提升至210% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","治疗量提升至230% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","治疗量提升至250% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提升自身攻击力，场上有“花灵”时额外提升攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升10%。场上存在友方“花灵”时，自身的攻击力额外提升5%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升12%。场上存在友方“花灵”时，自身的攻击力额外提升8%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升14%。场上存在友方“花灵”时，自身的攻击力额外提升11%。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","共鸣之花"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","“芽种”成长为“花灵”后，将会吸收治疗溢出效果，提供更多的增益。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","当\"芽种\"成长为\"花灵\"时，将会为被祝福友军带来一次永久性的祝福，使其提升娑丽丝初始攻击力4%的护甲和魔抗。“花灵”状态下，被祝福友军累计获得相当于娑丽丝初始攻击力600%的治疗溢出时，会使“花灵”永久升级，并使该友军额外提升娑丽丝初始攻击力7%的攻击力。“花灵”最多可以通过这种方式升级3次。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“芽种”成长为“花灵”后，该友军获得的护甲和魔抗提升至娑丽丝初始攻击力的6%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","当“花灵”升至满级后，会立即为被祝福成员带来永久性的最大生命值提升，提升值为娑丽丝初始攻击力的450%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“芽种”成长为“花灵”后，该友军获得的护甲和魔抗提升至娑丽丝初始攻击力的8%。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","“花灵”响应的伤害，将会附带累计的治疗溢出值一定比例的额外伤害。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","娑丽丝释放“万物有灵”时，“花灵”产生的伤害，将会额外附加其“花灵”状态期间已累积治疗溢出量的2%。最多不能超过娑丽丝初始攻击力的110%。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","暮霭药瓶"]]}